{"c":[{"id":"943dffc1dbc84f96","sum":"B26: Ask refusals and questions live in planner/says.ts (SaidError message for the user, detail for ids and provider errors); offline generator measurements must pin setGeneratorClock or cold forms hit the time budget.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261004T224111Z-32ca3d0fc6e98438","text":"B26: every Ask refusal or question sentence lives in planner/says.ts; a SaidError's message is what the user reads and its detail holds the check's text (ids, provider errors). Scoreboards print both.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T224111Z-6a820f7b64075f54","text":"B26: offline generator measurements (scripts/realfill-budgets.ts and the like) must pin setGeneratorClock, or cold first forms are cut short by the time budget and the numbers vary run to run.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"47481f5f6fb24ec8","sum":"D2-02: Jev Choice 'confidence' is the top-two margin (0.75 needs ~0.875 on the winner); Groq gpt-oss-120b, the Ask intent writer, allows 8,000 tokens/min, so Ask evals space calls 30 s.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261004T233505Z-310484d235184787","text":"D2-02: Jev Choice 'confidence' is the margin between the top two option probabilities (raw answers also carry 'probabilities'); a 0.75 floor needs about 0.875 on the winner.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T233506Z-254786afcaf981c8","text":"D2-02: Groq gpt-oss-120b (the Ask intent writer) allows 8,000 tokens a minute; an intent is about 2,000, so Ask evals space calls 30 s or get 429 'unavailable'.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
